 ## Languages

 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
-`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+`src/i18n/messages.js`. The server chooses the supported language with the
+highest positive quality value in `Accept-Language`. A missing quality value
+counts as 1, and ties use header order. Regional tags such as `ko-KR` match
+their base language. If no supported language is acceptable, the server uses
+`LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
